<section aria-labelledby="how-it-works-heading">
  <h2 id="how-it-works-heading">How it works</h2>

  <h3>1. Choose or create a vault</h3>
  <p>Use the default local vault or select another path with <code>--vault</code> or <code>DESKTOP_2FA_VAULT</code>.</p>

  <h3>2. Add TOTP entries</h3>
  <p>Use <code>d2fa add</code> to store an account's TOTP secret in the encrypted vault.</p>

  <h3>3. Generate and copy codes</h3>
  <p>Run <code>d2fa code &lt;name&gt;</code>; use <code>--copy</code> or <code>--copy-only</code> to copy the code.</p>

  <h3>4. Back up your vault</h3>
  <p>Create an encrypted backup with <code>d2fa backup</code> and store it somewhere safe. Backups are not automatic.</p>
</section>